        "citation": "AIR 1967 SC 1643",
        "year": "1967",
        "bench": "11-Judge Bench (Subba Rao CJ)",
        "ratio": "Subba Rao CJ observed that the Constituent Assembly possessed original constituent power, which Parliament acting under Article 368 lacks.",
        "impact": "Sparked the constitutional battle culminating in the 24th Amendment and Kesavananda Bharati."
